#: ../../install.md:1
msgid "安装与部署"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../install.md:3
msgid ""
"本文只讲「怎么把 sapic 跑起来」：环境要求、源码运行、生产入口与升级方式。 "
"只想尽快跑起来看效果，走[快速开始](quickstart.md)更短。 生产部署的完整命令（gunicorn + systemd + "
"nginx、容器与编排、数据库、备份回滚）见 [部署与运维](deploy.md)，配置项的含义见[配置](config.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This page only covers getting sapic running: requirements, running from "
"source, the production entry point and upgrades. If you just want it up "
"quickly, [Quick start](quickstart.md) is shorter. The full production "
"commands (gunicorn + systemd + nginx, containers and orchestration, "
"database, backup and rollback) are in [Deployment and "
"operations](deploy.md); what each option means is in "
"[Configuration](config.md)."

