msgid ""
"依赖由 `server/requirements/` 管理：`base.txt`（运行时，含内置钩子用到的 requests / Pillow /"
" 七牛 / 又拍云 SDK、缤纷云 S4 用的 boto3）、`dev.txt`（base + 测试）、 `prod.txt`（base + gunicorn + gevent +"
" setproctitle）。 第三方钩子是独立的 pip 包，自带自己的依赖。"
msgstr ""
"Dependencies are managed under `server/requirements/`: `base.txt` "
"(runtime, including the requests / Pillow / Qiniu / Upyun SDKs and boto3 "
"for Bitiful S4 used by the built-in hooks), `dev.txt` (base + tests) and "
"`prod.txt` (base + gunicorn + gevent). Third-party hooks are separate pip "
"packages with their own dependencies."

