msgstr ""
"Install the production dependencies and start the backend with gunicorn "
"(tune the worker count to your CPU cores):"

#: ../../install.md:57
msgid ""
"systemd 单元、nginx 站点（含 `sapic_proxyfix` 与 TLS 透传）、容器与集群编排、数据库选择见 "
"[部署与运维](deploy.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Deployment and operations](deploy.md) for the systemd unit, the "
"nginx site (including `sapic_proxyfix` and TLS passthrough), containers "
"and orchestration, and database choices."

#: ../../install.md:61
msgid ""
"`sapic_secretkey` **不是必填项**：内置默认密钥长度足够，单机自用不必配置。 "
"但它在开源代码里是公开串，**公网多用户**站点建议换掉（`server/.cfg` 或环境变量， 至少 14 字节，`openssl rand "
"-hex 32` 即可），否则读过源码的人能伪造会话 Cookie。"
msgstr ""
"`sapic_secretkey` is **not required**: the built-in default is long "
"enough and a single-user install can skip it. But it is a public string "
"in the open-source code, so a **public multi-user** site should replace "
"it (`server/.cfg` or an environment variable, at least 14 bytes — "
"`openssl rand -hex 32` is enough), otherwise anyone who has read the "
"source can forge session cookies."

#: ../../install.md:66
msgid "升级"
msgstr "Upgrading"

#: ../../install.md:68
msgid ""
"启动时会自动执行 `sapic/migrations` 里的幂等迁移（`auto_upgrade()`）； 手动兜底命令是 `cd server "
"&& FLASK_APP=sapic ../.venv/bin/python -m flask sa upgrade`。"
msgstr ""
"Idempotent migrations in `sapic/migrations` run automatically at startup "
"(`auto_upgrade()`); the manual fallback is `cd server && FLASK_APP=sapic "
"../.venv/bin/python -m flask sa upgrade`."

#: ../../install.md:70
msgid ""
"图片有效期清理除了定时兜底（`before_request` 每进程 5 分钟节流）， 还可由运维命令触发：`flask sa purge-"
"expired`。"
msgstr ""
"Expired images are also cleaned up on a timer (throttled to one batch per"
" process every 5 minutes), and the maintenance command can trigger it: "
"`flask sa purge-expired`."

#: ../../install.md:72
msgid ""
"拉代码、装依赖、重建前端与重启服务的完整流程，以及备份与回滚见[部署与运维](deploy.md)； 从 v1 迁移数据见[从 v1 "
"迁移数据](migrate-v1.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The full pull / install / rebuild / restart flow, plus backups and "
"rollback, is in [Deployment and operations](deploy.md); migrating data "
"from v1 is in [Migrating data from v1](migrate-v1.md)."

#: ../../install.md:75
msgid "客户端接入"
msgstr "Client setup"

#: ../../install.md:77
msgid ""
"PicGo、uTools、Typora、Windows / macOS 右键菜单与油猴脚本的配置方式和配套脚本， 统一整理在 "
"[快捷上传](usage.md)：所有客户端都用访问令牌（PAT）鉴权， 令牌在「设置 → 访问令牌」创建，只勾「上传图片」即可。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration and helper scripts for PicGo, uTools, Typora, the Windows /"
" macOS context menus and the userscript are collected in [Quick "
"upload](usage.md): every client authenticates with an access token (PAT),"
" created under Settings → Access tokens with only the upload scope "
"enabled."

